..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : ARTIKELAKTE.ME
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : carue
.. Funktion       : Datensammler fuer Business-App "Artikelakte"
.. Functionality  : Data miner for Buisiness App "Product File"
...Includes       :
..  include     st/ARTIKELAKTE.EINSTELLUNGEN
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Using Custom Settings
.. ---------------------
.. To assign custom settings create a file "ARTIKELAKTE.EINSTELLUNGEN"
.. in a working directory with higher priority than "st".
.. e.g. "ow1/ARTIKELAKTE.EINSTELLUNGEN"
..
.type text xtdefaultFOP
.formula U|xtdefaultFOP = "st/ARTIKELAKTE.EINSTELLUNGEN"
.type text xtcustomFOP
.formula U|xtcustomFOP = "ARTIKELAKTE.EINSTELLUNGEN"
..
.. Start empty
.make screen line -- ? M|tzeilen > 0
.copy M|kmaxanzahl = 0
.copy M|kmaxmenge = 0.0
..
.. Configureable behaviour
.input 'U|xtdefaultFOP'
.input 'U|xtcustomFOP'      ?  _M|kbstandard  &  F|foppath(U|xtcustomFOP) <> U|xtdefaultFOP
..
.. Calculate date ranges
.formula M|kvon = G|datum - M|ktagerueck
.formula M|kbis = G|datum + M|ktagevor
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
